Package: vespid-server
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-pip
Maintainer: Vespid Team <team@vespid.dev>
Homepage: https://github.com/your-org/vespid
Description: Vespid Server — centralized security event dashboard
 Vespid Server is a Flask-based centralized management server for the
 Vespid ecosystem. It receives SecurityEvent batches from distributed
 Vespid daemon instances, persists them in SQLite (or MySQL), and
 presents them through an HTMX-powered web dashboard.
 .
 Features include real-time SSE event streaming, whitelist/blacklist
 management with command push to nodes, centralized threat intelligence
 feed catalog, role-based access control, and geographic visualization.
